  "component_id": "caliptra_sha256",
  "kind": "peripheral",
  "description": "Unmodified Caliptra v2.1.2 sha256_ctrl, full-word aligned 32-bit AHB-Lite target. Generated full-word AHB register target with local real NAME/STATUS, write-only CTRL/BLOCK and SHA256 known-answer acceptance; CPU integration and persistent search remain unaccepted. reset_n and cptra_pwrgood are independent active-low asynchronous reset inputs and must both be asserted during initialization. Error/notification outputs are passive observations; no IRQ trigger/capture contract is granted. Wrapper ties AHB err=0/hld=0: internal register errors do not imply HRESP errors. Debug/scan input fixed zero.",
